	(155, 'National PMTCT Child Follow-Up Register and Mother Infant Pair Card', '2.1-2026-merged-cleaned', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, 'Merged PMTCT Child Follow-Up Register and Mother Infant Pair Card. Duplicate fields/sections removed and consolidated. The sex!==\'F\' gate refers to the client (mother) on whose chart this form is used, applied consistently across all clinical pages; the infant can be of either sex and infant-level fields (CTX, ARV/HIV prophylaxis, immunoglobulin) are not further restricted. Fields carrying a \'_note\' with FIXME_CONCEPT_COLLISION reuse a concept UUID with another unrelated field/answer in the source data and need a distinct concept assigned before this form is published.', 18, 1, '2026-07-09 01:47:56', 1, '2026-07-29 10:55:09', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '58dc997c-4c48-4c23-9549-9237579ead08'),
